  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\">\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"95%\">\n<tbody><tr><td>\n<font class=\"ver17px\" color=\"#292929\">UO.Cartoons</font>\n<img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/lomo/logo.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"32\" hspace=\"7\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:32/32\" width=\"32\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/images/_cl.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"3\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1/3\" width=\"1\">\n<br><font color=\"636363\">여러분이  만드신 만화를 올리게 됩니다.\n\n<br>열심히들 그리세요 ^3^</font>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br>\n\n<table bgcolor=\"black\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"95%\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td align=\"center\"><p style=\"color:#8c8c8c;font-size:11px\">원래는 그림을 누르면 다음 칸으로 넘어가는 슬라이드였습니다. 박물관에서는 모든 칸을 차례로 보여 줍니다.</p><table bgcolor=\"black\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" id=\"lomoimg01\" style=\"filter:blendTrans(Duration=0.7);width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr align=\"center\"><td><font color=\"bcbcbc\" id=\"lomotitle01\"><b>옛날옛적 한 정직한 나무꾼이 살았어요. 그는 매일 나무를 하며 살았답니다.</b></font></td></tr>\n<tr align=\"center\"><td valign=\"top\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/lomo/gm/lum_1.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" id=\"limg01\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"cursor:hand\" vspace=\"7\"></td></tr>\n<tr align=\"center\"><td><font class=\"ver10px\" color=\"8c8c8c\" id=\"lomonum01\"><b>1</b> <i>of</i> 8</font></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr valign=\"top\"><td align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" id=\"lomoimg02\" style=\"filter:blendTrans(Duration=0.7);width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr align=\"center\"><td><font color=\"bcbcbc\" id=\"lomotitle02\"><b>이런, 저를 어쩌나? 나무꾼은 도끼를 너무 힘차게 내두르다가 그만 손에서 도끼를 놓쳐버렸어요.</b></font></td></tr>\n<tr align=\"center\"><td valign=\"top\"><img border=\"0\" id=\"limg02\" src=\"/img/posts/site/lomo/gm/lum_2.gif\" style=\"cursor:hand\" vspace=\"7\"></td></tr>\n<tr align=\"center\"><td><font class=\"ver10px\" color=\"8c8c8c\" id=\"lomonum02\"><b>2</b> <i>of</i> 8</font></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr valign=\"top\"><td align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" id=\"lomoimg03\" style=\"filter:blendTrans(Duration=0.7);width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr align=\"center\"><td><font color=\"bcbcbc\" id=\"lomotitle03\"><b>저런저런, 도끼가 물에 빠져버렸군요.</b></font></td></tr>\n<tr align=\"center\"><td valign=\"top\"><img border=\"0\" id=\"limg03\" src=\"/img/posts/site/lomo/gm/lum_3.gif\" style=\"cursor:hand\" vspace=\"7\"></td></tr>\n<tr align=\"center\"><td><font class=\"ver10px\" color=\"8c8c8c\" id=\"lomonum03\"><b>3</b> <i>of</i> 8</font></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr valign=\"top\"><td align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" id=\"lomoimg04\" style=\"filter:blendTrans(Duration=0.7);width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr align=\"center\"><td><font color=\"bcbcbc\" id=\"lomotitle04\"><b>앗... 그런데 한숨만 내쉬던 나무꾼 앞에 갑자기 겜마님이 나타났어요.</b></font></td></tr>\n<tr align=\"center\"><td valign=\"top\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/lomo/gm/lum_4.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" id=\"limg04\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"cursor:hand\" vspace=\"7\"></td></tr>\n<tr align=\"center\"><td><font class=\"ver10px\" color=\"8c8c8c\" id=\"lomonum04\"><b>4</b> <i>of</i> 8</font></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr valign=\"top\"><td align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" id=\"lomoimg05\" style=\"filter:blendTrans(Duration=0.7);width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr align=\"center\"><td><font color=\"bcbcbc\" id=\"lomotitle05\"><b>겜마님은 나무꾼에게 물었어요. 나무꾼은 정직하게 대답했답니다.</b></font></td></tr>\n<tr align=\"center\"><td valign=\"top\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/lomo/gm/lum_5.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" id=\"limg05\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"cursor:hand\" vspace=\"7\"></td></tr>\n<tr align=\"center\"><td><font class=\"ver10px\" color=\"8c8c8c\" id=\"lomonum05\"><b>5</b> <i>of</i> 8</font></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr valign=\"top\"><td align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" id=\"lomoimg06\" style=\"filter:blendTrans(Duration=0.7);width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr align=\"center\"><td><font color=\"bcbcbc\" id=\"lomotitle06\"><b>겜마님은 다른 도끼를 꺼내어 다시 물어봤답니다. 그러나 나무꾼은 역시 정직하게 대답했답니다.</b></font></td></tr>\n<tr align=\"center\"><td valign=\"top\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/lomo/gm/lum_6.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" id=\"limg06\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing-slot.svg\" style=\"cursor:hand\" vspace=\"7\"></td></tr>\n<tr align=\"center\"><td><font class=\"ver10px\" color=\"8c8c8c\" id=\"lomonum06\"><b>6</b> <i>of</i> 8</font></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr valign=\"top\"><td align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" id=\"lomoimg07\" style=\"filter:blendTrans(Duration=0.7);width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr align=\"center\"><td><font color=\"bcbcbc\" id=\"lomotitle07\"><b>겜마님은 한번 더 물었답니다.</b></font></td></tr>\n<tr align=\"center\"><td valign=\"top\"><img border=\"0\" id=\"limg07\" src=\"/img/posts/site/lomo/gm/lum_7.gif\" style=\"cursor:hand\" vspace=\"7\"></td></tr>\n<tr align=\"center\"><td><font class=\"ver10px\" color=\"8c8c8c\" id=\"lomonum07\"><b>7</b> <i>of</i> 8</font></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr><tr valign=\"top\"><td align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" id=\"lomoimg08\" style=\"filter:blendTrans(Duration=0.7);width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr align=\"center\"><td><font color=\"bcbcbc\